(guided-missile-cases)
*title Named launch-geometry case study
*method rk4-fixed
*atmos 1
*earth wgs-84
*file guided_missile_cases.dat time alt vel range gamgd psigd wt

*define initial variables
  launch_lat = 22.0;
  launch_long = -159.8;
  target_lat = 39.5;
  target_long = -175.5;
  surface_ref(launch_lat,launch_long);
  launch_azimuth = surface_azm(target_lat,target_long);
  target_distance = surface_dist(target_lat,target_long);

*trajectory 1 guided_vehicle start on 1
  *initial geodetic time=0 wt=40400 alt=0 lat=launch_lat long=launch_long vel=0 gama=90 psi=launch_azimuth
  *print time alt latgd long vel range gamgd psigd wt launch_azimuth
  *segment 1 powered-ascent
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.05
    *aero caxial=0.7 cnormal=0.1
    *prop vacuum thrust=96500 mdot=396.5 snoz=3.928
    *when tseg>5 goto 2
  *segment 2 coast-to-apogee
    *aero constant_beta=2000
    *when gamgd<0 goto 3
  *segment 3 impact
    *aero constant_beta=2000
    *when alt<0 stop

*optimize a for vel=max on segment 3, trajectory 1
  par-1=launch_azimuth lo-1=-180 hi-1=180 ref-1=90
*cases
  case launch_lat launch_long target_lat target_long
  1 22.0 -159.8 39.5 -175.5
  2 35.0 -106.5 37.0 -83.05
*summarize apogee decm=0
  add maxfit(alt[1])
*summarize final_distance decm=2
  add target_distance
*end
